+# Platform documentation audit — TASK-261010-2iqn63
+
+Research handoff, 2026-10-10. Scope: documentation and diagram consistency; proposed repairs only.
+
+The architecture is described extensively, but a reader cannot yet derive one consistent implementation contract. The highest-value corrections are the dispatcher signature domain, privileged launch ordering and limits, executor/runner ownership, credential phase boundaries, goal authority, and donor trust bootstrap. These are documented below as contradictions or missing contracts, not inferred runtime defects. [B05:L97–100](https://github.com/relux-works/wiki/blob/2e30edbd54977b306ab53497663fcd94a5ca6cb6/book/swarma/ru/05-granty.md#L97-L100 "wiki/book/swarma/ru/05-granty.md — Грант вызывающего как зависимость") [DP:L69–86](https://github.com/relux-works/swarma-dispatcher/blob/9cec4115b8666aa1f3325a792359135a9df5a2f7/spec/dispatcher.md#L69-L86 "swarma-dispatcher/spec/dispatcher.md — 3.2 Callers") [B03:L17–48](https://github.com/relux-works/wiki/blob/2e30edbd54977b306ab53497663fcd94a5ca6cb6/book/swarma/ru/03-polzovatel-na-agenta.md#L17-L48 "wiki/book/swarma/ru/03-polzovatel-na-agenta.md — Как создаётся пользователь") [UM:L184–209](https://github.com/relux-works/swarma-user-manager/blob/92bdf1d59478b8fd28d2d98cfe9fb95716d10e8e/spec/helper.md#L184-L209 "swarma-user-manager/spec/helper.md — 7. The launcher (`swarma-user-launcher`)") [B07:L13–45](https://github.com/relux-works/wiki/blob/2e30edbd54977b306ab53497663fcd94a5ca6cb6/book/swarma/ru/07-host-sessiy.md#L13-L45 "wiki/book/swarma/ru/07-host-sessiy.md — Две половины: служба и раннер сессии") [SH:L105–123](https://github.com/relux-works/swarma-session-host/blob/2bb9fda8ed923266532f331c9e692ba88b5c4cb6/spec/session-host.md#L105-L123 "swarma-session-host/spec/session-host.md — 3.1 Service account, state and capabilities") [C09:L129–158](https://github.com/relux-works/curator-spec/blob/1604d4022f97d6f0751e17a37c549d2a10581829/cips/CIP-0009-donor-side-deployment-and-bridge.md#L129-L158 "curator-spec/cips/CIP-0009-donor-side-deployment-and-bridge.md — Recommendation")
+
+The module specifications are explicitly design-stage documents; the session-host repository additionally contains generic extraction-gate tooling. This audit does not certify runtime implementation, provider compatibility, successful extraction, or any previously reported test result. [CB:L1–5](https://github.com/relux-works/swarma-credential-broker/blob/f910e68f882900f03ffd036ecc2481f35bf8988b/spec/broker.md#L1-L5 "swarma-credential-broker/spec/broker.md — swarma-credential-broker: specification") [UM:L1–9](https://github.com/relux-works/swarma-user-manager/blob/92bdf1d59478b8fd28d2d98cfe9fb95716d10e8e/spec/helper.md#L1-L9 "swarma-user-manager/spec/helper.md — swarma-user-manager: specification") [DP:L1–11](https://github.com/relux-works/swarma-dispatcher/blob/9cec4115b8666aa1f3325a792359135a9df5a2f7/spec/dispatcher.md#L1-L11 "swarma-dispatcher/spec/dispatcher.md — swarma-dispatcher: specification") [SH:L1–6](https://github.com/relux-works/swarma-session-host/blob/2bb9fda8ed923266532f331c9e692ba88b5c4cb6/spec/session-host.md#L1-L6 "swarma-session-host/spec/session-host.md — curator-session-host: specification") [SG:L3–20](https://github.com/relux-works/swarma-session-host/blob/2bb9fda8ed923266532f331c9e692ba88b5c4cb6/docs/sh1-gate.md#L3-L20 "swarma-session-host/docs/sh1-gate.md — SH1 gate interface")
