+Book-span coverage measures source text assigned to matrix groups; it does not mechanically prove the semantic judgement in each row. Those mappings, contradictions and figure currency were reviewed against the cited text. Two renders were visually inspected; no claim is made that every render was visually reviewed, rebuilt, or that its toolchain is reproducible. Prior CI/provider/model-check claims were read as historical documentation, not rerun or accepted as current passes. No product validation, provider login, build, renderer, deployment or source-repository mutation ran on this host.
+
+The study records documentary contradictions and precise proposed repairs. It does not authorize provider-account experiments, infer capability from prose, or change the audited repositories. The worktree change is this research document only; LOGBOOK remains untouched. Board outcome attachment and researcher handoff are recorded separately by the task-board lifecycle.
